  "description": "A knight from the distant world of Envylia. Logi tried to quell a rebellion planned by the remnants of Wratharis, a neighbouring country that was ruined some 20 years ago. Curiously, amidst his efforts to quench the rebellion alongside his friend Dias, he experienced a most unexpected encounter with the enemy. Cornered by the rebels who seem to wield the forbidden power of Alchemy, Logi somehow gains this power himself upon a fateful meeting with a strange young girl. With this taboo ability now at his disposal, Logi plans to continue fighting to protect the world.",
  "summon": "I wonder if you and I will evershare an unbreakable bond...No, I'm sure we will!",
